he African groups are from Egypt while most of the Asian groups (with the exception of the Aki Ten and the eastern branch of Hotel Mascaron) come from the Middle East. Oceania, however, has no hunters in it- at least, from the groups I've gathered. I think that it shows were new homebrews and canon groups are needed- European and US groups are all nice and well, but it makes the rest of the world kinda empty.<br /> <br /> please note me for any mistakes, either in the locations or the writers of the organizations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 07-28-2017, 05:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T10:02:27-07:00","id":518265,"title":"","content":"Once you get to the global category things start getting contradictory. The Marduk Society for example, started in ancient Mesopotamia but right now their headquarters is orbiting the earth and are active on every continent. However they're labled Iraq, while someone like Network-0 is labled global.<br /> <br /> I'd stick with either origins or current HQ, 