m/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/518231-hunters-around-the-globe?p=521931#post521931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">very well, fixed. Also, what's up with Massachusetts? I mean, it looks like the place is crawling with hunters! Maybe it is because I'm not an american, but I've always thought that New York would be more in the &quot;center of attention&quot;... or maybe it is because the monsters has already took over New York?<br /> <br /> EDIT- then again, it could be the Salem effect from Dark Eras :P</div> </div> </div> </div> It's a cultural thing that has nothing to do with the game. In the U.S. if you mention aliens we think of Roswell NM, technology is Silicon Valley California and the supernatural takes us to Salem Massachusetts. The actual number of sightings, inventions and incidents no longer matter because the associations are strong enough to stand on their own . \u200b<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T12:18:30-08:00","id":808131,"title":"","content":"changed the S (Slashing) index into C (Cabal) index, considering it is going to be the canon term for such groups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &q